    "created_at": "2020-04-24T11:28:28Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-04-24T11:28:28Z",
    "body": "I pushed a commit that changed the cross-origin opener policy value explanations and also did some editorial changes. Things that remain:\r\n\r\n* The incumbent variables need a new name.\r\n* We should link to the actual algorithm that obtains a cross-origin embedder policy (at the moment obtain is not a link).\r\n* We should consider changing COOP to be a structured header. I'd be okay with this being a follow-up though.\r\n\r\nI suspect I need at least one more pass after that and @domenic should maybe review as well, but things are looking pretty good to me.\r\n\r\n(Feel free to make changes as subsequent commits by the way. We'll squash it all together when everyone is satisfied.)",
