    "body": "Thanks for your review Anne! I have pushed a new version that:\r\n- changes the incumbent variable names - to make sure I understand correctly, in the navigation algorithm incumbentNavigationOrigin is the current origin and activeDocumentNavigationOrigin is the origin we are navigating to?\r\n- Adds a link to the algorithm for obtaining COEP\r\n- and makes COOP a structured header (note that I had to import a bunch of definitions to do so, let me know if I have missed something).\r\n\r\nThanks!",
