    "created_at": "2020-06-18T13:27:55Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-06-18T13:41:41Z",
    "body": "Looking at various algorithms such as \"process a navigate fetch\" and its callers, I think that #4664 and #5098 ended up not updating various callers for these algorithms and sometimes even not update the signatures for these algorithms. And untangling this is tricky as it's not always clear what to pass. I guess I'll try to fix what I can and insert some `<!-- TODO -->` comments or some such to indicate what is missing.\r\n\r\nEdit: this might be smaller than I thought, though it's hard to say for sure.",
